(δ) Την εντολή που πρέπει να τοποθετηθεί στη **θέση Δ**, έτσι ώστε να εκχωρείται στην μεταβλητή **r2** το ακέραιο μέρος της μεταβλητής **r1**.

(ε) Την εντολή που πρέπει να τοποθετηθεί στη **θέση Ε**, έτσι ώστε να τυπώνεται η τιμή της μεταβλητής **r1** με ακρίβεια δύο (2) δεκαδικών ψηφίων.

problems.problem:
(a) The following program in the C++ programming language is given. Using any method (e.g. the method of a dry run), write the results of the program as they will be printed on the screen.

```C++
#include<iostream>
using namespace std;

int syn3a(int a, int &b){
    int c = 0;
    for(int i=a; i<=b; i+=2)
        c += i;
    a++;
    b++;
return c;
}
int main(){
    int x = 2, y = 7, z;
    z = syn3a(x,y);
    cout << x << endl;
    cout << y << endl;
    cout << z;
return 0;
}
```

(b) The following program, in the C++ programming language, reads the string **stA** from the keyboard. It then calls the function **syn3b**, which takes the string stA as a parameter. The function syn3b computes and returns to the main function (**main**) the number of uppercase characters of the Latin alphabet contained in the string stA. The returned value is printed in the main function.

The program contains logical and/or syntax errors. Write in your answer book **four (4)** of them, stating the number of the line in which each error appears together with the corrected statement. **No statement may be added to or removed from** the program.

